  <para style="h">Kolosayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye ab’i Kolosayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye ab’i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolosayi</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Jewe Pawulo, intumwa ya Kristo Yesu kubera ugushaka kw’Imana, na mwene Data Timoteyo,<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Turabandikiye mwebwe abera b’Imana bo mu gisagara c’i Kolosayi, bene Data b’abizigirwa muri Kristo:</para>
  <para style="po" vid="COL 1:2">Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data wa twese bibe muri mwebwe.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gushima Imana no gusenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Imisi yose dushima Imana, Se w’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, iyo turiko turabasengera, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />kuko twumvise ukwizera Kristo Yesu kwanyu n’urukundo mufitiye abera b’Imana bose. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Ukwo kwizera n’urwo rukundo vyubakiye ku kwizigira ivyo Imana ibabikiye mw’ijuru. Ivyo vyizigiro na vyo mwabikuye mw’ijambo ry’ukuri mwumvise, ari ryo Butumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Ubwo Butumwa Bwiza bwabashikiriye ni na bwo buriko burakwiragira kw’isi yose. Buriko burama ivyamwa bwongera bugwira, nk’uko vyagenze no muri mwebwe uhereye igihe mwabwumviye ubwa mbere, mugatahura ubuntu bw’Imana nk’uko bumeze vy’ukuri. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Mwabubwiwe na Epafura, umukozi w’Imana dukunda kandi dusangiye igikorwa, akaba n’umukozi wa Kristo w’umwizigirwa abakorera. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Ni we yatubwiye ivy’urukundo rwanyu mwahawe na Mpwemu.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Ni co gituma, kuva igihe twumviye ivyanyu, tudahengeshanya kubasengera, dusaba Imana ngo ibuzuze ukumenya ivyo igomba mu bwenge bwose n’ugutahura bitangwa na Mpwemu, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />kugira ngo mubeho nk’uko bibereye ab’Umwami Yesu, mwongere mumunezereze muri vyose: mwama ivyamwa mu gikorwa ciza cose kandi mukura mu vyo kumenya Imana. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Turanabasengera ngo mukomezwe n’ubushobozi bwose bw’ubwiza bwiwe, kugira ngo mushobore kwihanganira vyose no kurindirana umunezero, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />mushima Data yabashoboje gusangira n’abera biwe umugabane wo mu bwami bw’umuco. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Yaradukijije adukura mu bubasha bw’umwijima, adushira mu bwami bw’Umwana wiwe akunda. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Muri we ni ho twaherewe ugucungurwa, ari kwo guharirwa ivyaha.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo arengeye vyose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kristo ni we shusho iboneka y’Imana itaboneka, imfura irengeye ivyaremwe vyose, <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />kuko vyose vyaremwe biciye muri we: ivyo mw’ijuru n’ivyo kw’isi, ibiboneka n’ibitaboneka, zaba intebe z’ubwami, ubukuru, ubutware, ubutegetsi; vyose vyaremwe biciye muri we, kandi biremerwa kuba ivyiwe. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />We yabayeho vyose bitarabaho, kandi muri we ni ho vyose bifatanirizwa. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Ni we mutwe w’umubiri, ari ryo shengero; ni we tanguriro kandi ni we mfura mu kuzuka mu bapfuye; kugira ngo muri vyose abe agaheta, <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />kuko Imana yahimbawe n’uko ubumana bwayo bwuzuye buba muri we, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />kandi biciye muri we yiyujuje n’ibintu vyose, vyaba ibiri kw’isi canke ibiri mw’ijuru; izanishije amahoro amaraso yiwe, ayo yaviriye ku musaraba.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Kera mwari kure y’Imana kandi mwari abansi bayo mu vyiyumviro vyanyu no mu bikorwa vyanyu bibi. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ariko ubu yariyujuje namwe mu mubiri wa Kristo biciye mu rupfu rwiwe, kugira ngo ibashikane imbere yayo mwejejwe, mutagira agatosi kandi ata n’ico mwogawa, <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />nimba vy’ukuri mwagumye mu kwizera, mushinzwe neza kandi mutanyiganyiga mu vyizigiro vyanyu biva mu Butumwa Bwiza. Ubwo ni bwo mwumvise kandi bwavuzwe mu vyaremwe vyose biri musi y’ijuru. Ubwo ni bwo jewe, Pawulo, nabereye umukozi.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubutame bwa Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ubu nezererewe imibabaro ndiko ndacamwo ku bwanyu. Mu mubiri wanje, ndiko ndashitsa ibisigaye ku mibabaro ya Kristo ku bw’umubiri wiwe, ari ryo Shengero. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Nahindutse umukozi waryo kubera igikorwa Imana yanjeje muri mwebwe co kubashikiriza ijambo ryayo ryuzuye. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Iryo jambo ni ibanga ryari ryarahishijwe imyaka n’iyindi, ariko ubu ryahishuriwe abizera. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Imana yahisemwo kumenyekanisha mu Banyamahanga ubutunzi n’ubwiza bw’iryo banga; iryo banga ni Kristo ari muri mwebwe, ivyizigiro vy’ubwiza.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Ni we twamamaza, tuburira kandi twigisha umuntu wese mu bwenge bwose, kugira ngo dushikane umuntu wese kuri Kristo, akuze mu buryo bw’impwemu ata co ahajije. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Ni co gituma nkora nkaruha cane, nkagwanisha ubushobozi bwiwe bwinshi bukorera muri jewe mu nkomezi nyinshi.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Ndashaka ko mumenya ukuntu ndabagwanira intambara ihambaye mwebwe n’ab’i Lawodikiya, hamwe n’abatarigera bambona na rimwe bose. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Intumbero yanje ni uko bose baremeshwa mu mitima yabo bari mu bumwe buva mu rukundo, kugira ngo bagire ubutunzi bwuzuye buva mu gutahura gushitse, gutuma bamenya ibanga ry’Imana, ari ryo Kristo. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Muri we ni ho ubutunzi bwose bw’ubwenge no kumenya bihishijwe. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Ndababwiye ivyo kugira ngo ntihagire umuntu n’umwe abahendesha akarimi gasosa. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Kuko n’aho tutari kumwe mu mubiri, ndi kumwe namwe mu mpwemu nkanezerezwa no kubabona muhagaze neza kandi mushikamye mu kwizera Kristo kwanyu.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubuzima bunengesereye muri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Nuko rero, nk’uko mwakiriye Kristo Yesu nk’Umwami, abe ari ko mushishikara kuba muri we, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />mushinze imizi kandi mwubatswe neza muri we, mukomeye mu kwizera nk’uko mwigishijwe, kandi amashimwe yanyu ari menshi asesekaye.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Mwirinde ntihagire umuntu n’umwe abagira inyagano akoresheje amajambo y’uruhendo, yubakiye ku migenzo y’abantu hamwe n’ivya mbere vy’impwemu kandi vy’iyi si, ariko atari ivya Kristo.<verse eid="COL 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Kuko muri Kristo ari ho ukunengesera kw’Imana kuza kukaba mu buryo bw’umubiri. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Kandi mwahawe ukunengesera muri Kristo, we mutwe w’ubukuru bwose n’ukuganza kwose. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Muri we mwarakebwe ugukebwa kutari ukwo mu buryo bw’umubiri. Ni ugukebwa mwakebwe na Kristo kwo kubambura akamere k’icaha <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Kuko igihe mwabatizwa mwahambanywe na we hanyuma muzukana na we kugira ngo mubeho ubuzima bushasha mwaronse biciye mu kwizera ubushobozi bw’Imana, yamuzuye imukuye mu bapfuye.<verse eid="COL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Igihe mwari mugipfuye mwishwe n’ivyaha vyanyu hamwe no kudakebwa kwa kamere kanyu k’icaha, Imana yabahinduye bazima muri Kristo. Yaduhariye ivyaha vyacu vyose, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />ihindura ubusa icanditswe catwagiriza kandi cadutsindisha; igikuraho, ikibamba ku musaraba. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Yambuye ibigwanisho abakuru n’abatware, abateterereza ahabona mu maso ya bose, abaneshesheje uwo musaraba.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwidegemvyo ku mabwirizwa y’abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Nuko rero ntimwemere ko hagira umuntu n’umwe abacira urubanza ku vyo murya canke munywa, canke ku misi mikuru y’idini, iy’ukwezi guserutse canke umusi w’Isabato. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Ivyo vyari igitutu c’ivyari bigiye kuzoza; ariko ishusho y’ukuri yari umubiri wa Kristo ubwiwe. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Ntihagire umuntu n’umwe abacira urubanza kubera inyungu mbi yishimikije uguca bugufi kutari kwo no gusenga abamarayika. Yihayagiza ko ivyo ari ivyo yeretswe. Ubwenge bwabo bwuzuye ivyaha butuma bishira hejuru ku vy’ubusa gusa. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Ntibagifatanye n’umutwe, ari wo Kristo, umubiri wose wisunga, ufatanijwe n’imitsi n’imisokoro, ugakura uko Imana ibitegetse.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Ko mwapfanye na Kristo ku vya mbere vy’impwemu kandi vy’iyi si, ni kuki, nk’aho mukiganzwa na yo, mucumvira amategeko yayo avuga ngo: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Ntufate iki! Ntiwumvirize kuri kirya! Ntukore kuri kiriya!”? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Amategeko nk’ayo ni inyigisho z’abantu zijanye n’ibintu bigenda birahera uko tuba turiko turabikoresha. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Ayo mategeko mu vy’ukuri aboneka nk’aho womenga arimwo ubwenge, kuko asaba abantu gusenga uko bibwirije, no kwiyanka hamwe no kubabaza umubiri. Ariko nta bushobozi na bukeya afise bwo kunesha ivyipfuzo vy’umubiri.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Uburyo umuntu yobaho ubuzima bwejejwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />None rero ko mwazuranywe na Kristo, mushire imitima yanyu ku biri mw’ijuru, aho Kristo yicaye mu kibanza c’iteka i buryo bw’Imana. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Ubwenge bwanyu mubushire ku biri mw’ijuru, ntimubushire ku biri mw’isi. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Kuko mwapfuye, ubugingo bwanyu bukaba buhishijwe hamwe na Kristo mu Mana. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Aho Kristo, we bugingo bwanyu azoserukira, namwe muzoserukana na we muri mu bwiza.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Nuko rero, mwice ibintu vyose vya kamere k’isi: ubusambanyi, ibihumanya, ivyipfuzo vy’umubiri, ivyipfuzo bibi n’ugukunda amahera, ari kwo gusenga ibigirwamana. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Kuko ivyo bizotuma uburake bw’Imana buza. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Kera namwe mwabigenderamwo, mukiri mu buzima bwanyu bwo mw’isi. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ariko ubu mukwiye kwiyambura ibintu vyose bisa n’ibi: uburake, kujingitwa, ububi bwose, kuvuga abandi nabi, kandi ntihagire amajambo ateye isoni asohoka ava mu kanwa kanyu. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Ntimukabeshane kuko mwiyambuye wa muntu wa kera n’ibikorwa vyiwe, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />mukambara umuntu mushasha. Uwo na we yama ahinduka mu gutahura, akama arondera gusa n’Umuremyi wiwe. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Aha ntihaba hakiri Umugiriki canke Umuyuda, uwakebwe canke uwutakebwe, uwateye imbere canke uwutaratera imbere, umugurano canke uwidegemvya, ariko ni Kristo ari vyose kandi ari muri bose.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Nuko rero nk’abatoranijwe n’Imana, bera kandi bakundwa cane, mwambare umutima w’ikigongwe, ubugwaneza, guca bugufi, ubwitonzi no kwihangana. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Mushigikirane kandi mubabarirane iyo umuntu agize ico apfa na mugenziwe. Mubabarirane nk’uko Umwami Yesu yabababariye namwe. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Kandi ikirengeye vyose mwambare urukundo, ni wo mugozi udufatanya twese mu bumwe bushitse.<verse eid="COL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Amahoro ya Kristo aganze mu mitima yanyu. Kuko nk’uko mugize ingingo z’umubiri umwe, mwahamagariwe kubana mu mahoro. Kandi mube abama bashima. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Ijambo rya Kristo ribe muri mwebwe rigwiriye, mwigishanye kandi muhanurane mu bwenge bwose, muririmba amazaburi n’indirimbo n’amatazirano muhawe na Mpwemu mushima Imana mu mitima yanyu. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kandi ivyo mukora vyose, mu mvugo no mu ngiro, mubikore mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu, mushima Imana Data wa twese ku bwiwe.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uko Umukristo akwiye kubana n’abandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Bagore, mwumvire abagabo banyu, nk’uko bibereye ab’Umwami wacu.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Bagabo, mukunde abagore banyu ntimubababaze ku mitima.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Bana, mwubahe abavyeyi banyu muri vyose, kuko ari vyo bihimbara Umwami wacu.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Ba se, ntimukabere abana banyu umururazi, vyotuma bacika intege.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Bagurano, mwumvire ba shobuja bo muri iyi si muri vyose; kandi mubigire atari iyo babahagarikiye gusa murondera ko bobashima, ariko mubikore n’umutima ubikunze mubitewe no kwubaha Umwami wacu. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Ivyo mukora vyose muhore mubikorana umutima wanyu wose, nk’aho mwoba muriko mubikorera Umwami wacu, atari abantu, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />kuko muzi ko muzohabwa n’Umwami wacu, umugabane wanyu nk’impera. Uwo Mwami mukorera ni Kristo. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Uwukora ikibi azohembwa ikibi, kuko Imana idaca urwa nkunzi.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Ba shebuja, mugirire ibigororotse kandi bibereye abagurano banyu, kuko mubizi namwe ko mufise Shobuja Mukuru mw’ijuru.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impanuro zo guherezako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Mushishikare gusenga, mube maso kandi mushima. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Kandi natwe mudusengere, kugira ngo Imana itwugururire umuryango wo kuvuga Ubutumwa, tumenyeshe abantu ibanga rya Kristo, iryo mbohewe. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Munsengere kugira ngo ndaryamamaze mu buryo butomoye, nk’uko ntegerezwa. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Mugire ubwenge ku kuntu mubana n’abantu bo hanze; kandi mukoreshe neza akaryo kose muhawe. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Ibiyago vyanyu bibe vyuzuyemwo ubuntu, birunzwe umunyu, kugira ngo mumenye uko mwishura umuntu wese.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Gusezera n’intasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tukiko azobabwira amakuru yose anyerekeye. Ni mwene Data dukunda, umukozi w’umwizigirwa, uwo dusangiye igikorwa c’Umwami. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ni muri iyo ntumbero ndamubarungikiye, kugira ngo mumenye uko tumerewe yongere aremeshe imitima yanyu. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Azananye na Onezime, umuvukanyi w’umwizigirwa, umwe muri mwebwe. Bazobabwira ibiriko birabera hano vyose.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Arisitariko, mugenzi wacu dupfunganywe, arabaramutsa, hamwe na Mariko, muvyara wa Baranaba. (Mwarasiguriwe ivyiwe; niyaza iwanyu muze mumwakire.)<verse eid="COL 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yesu twita Yusito, na we nyene arabaramutsa. Abo ni bo bonyene bo mu Bayuda dukorana ivy’Ubwami bw’Imana, kandi bambereye indemeshanyo ikomeye cane.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafura, umwe muri mwebwe kandi akaba umukozi wa Kristo Yesu, arabaramutsa. Yama imisi yose abagwanira intambara mu gusenga, kugira ngo muhagarare mushikamye, mukuze mu mpwemu kandi mushize amanga, mwiteguriye gukora ivyo Imana igomba vyose. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Ndamushingira intahe ko yitanga ku bwanyu mwe n’ab’i Lawodikiya bose n’i Hiyerapolisi.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Muganga Luka, umuvukanyi akaba n’umugenzi, na Dema barabaramutsa.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Muntahirize abavukanyi b’i Lawodikiya, na Nimfa hamwe n’ishengero rikoranira mu nzu yiwe.<verse eid="COL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Iri kete nimwamara kurisomerwa, mukore ibishoboka vyose kugira ngo risomerwe abo mw’ishengero ry’i Lawodikiya, kandi namwe muze musome iryo bazobarungikira.<verse eid="COL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Mumbwirire Arukipo muti: “Gira ibishoboka vyose ushitse igikorwa wahawe n’Umwami.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Jewe Pawulo, ndabandikiye ndabatasha n’ukuboko kwanje. Ubuntu bw’Imana bubane namwe.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>